&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 742.517px;&quot; width=&quot;437&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full certification sponsorship, structured learning paths, and direct mentorship from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
