&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SimplifyNext is a Singapore-headquartered digital engineering firm, with offices in Thailand and Malaysia, working across three converged areas: agentic AI, AI-enabled application modernisation, and intelligent automation.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We bring strong business process consulting together with deep technology skills and modern delivery practices – product-centric, agile and AI-assisted. We build bespoke applications and AI systems, and we go deep on the platforms our clients run on, including Microsoft, AWS, ServiceNow, Databricks and UiPath. That combination of engineering depth and platform depth is what our clients come to us for.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We build and modernise the systems people depend on daily. Our 300+ practitioners are multi-disciplinary by design – business consultants, software engineers, architects, AI engineers and designers working on the same delivery, not handing off between silos. We focus on delivering outcomes for clients, building strong careers for our people, and staying ahead of the technology curve. We hire because we are growing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;306&quot; data-end=&quot;651&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;SimplifyNext&lt;/strong&gt;, we help businesses transform the way they work through automation, analytics, and cutting-edge technologies. Our goal is to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;simplify the complex&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling our clients to unlock efficiencies and drive meaningful business outcomes. We’re a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;569&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;fast-moving, high-impact team&lt;/strong&gt; that thrives on solving real-world challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;653&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;driven, strategic, and relentless sales leader&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. If you are a true &lt;strong data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;771&quot;&gt;hunter&lt;/strong&gt; who enjoys opening doors, building deep client relationships, and driving &lt;strong data-start=&quot;846&quot; data-end=&quot;869&quot;&gt;new business growth&lt;/strong&gt;, this is the opportunity for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;Sales Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a pivotal role in expanding SimplifyNext’s footprint in the &lt;strong&gt;Singapore Market&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be responsible for identifying, engaging, and closing new opportunities with named accounts while deepening relationships with existing clients. You will act as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1244&quot;&gt;trusted advisor&lt;/strong&gt;, helping clients scale their automation and analytics capabilities, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1394&quot;&gt;positioning SimplifyNext as the go-to partner for digital transformation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this role, you will need to bring together the relevant expertise and thought leadership from within SimplifyNext to deliver successful outcomes for our clients as well as SimplifyNext. Our simple and flat organization structure and collaborative culture is an enabler for high-performing sales professionals to thrive in and express themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities would include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
