&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own backend services and frontend interfaces – from the API and business logic all the way through to what the user actually sees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take features from 0 to 1 when there&#39;s nothing there yet, and confidently improve systems that already exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the integration layer that lets different systems – and in some projects, different business units / organizations – talk to each other and share data reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take real ownership through deployment and monitoring – not just “write code and hand it off”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with PMs, designers, BAs, and QA to turn requirements into shipped, tested, working software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
