&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re hiring across levels – from around 3 years to 8+ years of experience. Depending on your depth in the areas below, tell us where you land and we will match you to the right level of role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack ability, with real depth in at least one of:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend: Kotlin, Golang, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend: Next.js, React, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and owning systems end-to-end, not just contributing to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid coding fundamentals – you can write and reason about production code independently, without needing an AI assistant to do the thinking for you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable digging into legacy systems and making them better, not just building new things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git, microservices, event-driven systems (Kafka, RabbitMQ), containers (Docker, Kubernetes), and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
