&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SimplifyNext is a Singapore-headquartered digital engineering firm, with offices in Thailand and Malaysia, working across three converged areas: agentic AI, AI-enabled application modernisation, and intelligent automation.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We bring strong business process consulting together with deep technology skills and modern delivery practices – product-centric, agile and AI-assisted. We build bespoke applications and AI systems, and we go deep on the platforms our clients run on, including Microsoft, AWS, ServiceNow, Databricks and UiPath. That combination of engineering depth and platform depth is what our clients come to us for.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We build and modernise the systems people depend on daily. Our 300+ practitioners are multi-disciplinary by design – business consultants, software engineers, architects, AI engineers and designers working on the same delivery, not handing off between silos. We focus on delivering outcomes for clients, building strong careers for our people, and staying ahead of the technology curve. We hire because we are growing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Senior Project Manager is responsible for delivering customer digital products from discovery through launch, using agile delivery practices. This role sits at the intersection of project management discipline and digital product thinking – partnering closely with customers, product owners, designers, and engineers to ensure scope, timeline, quality, and commercial outcomes are consistently met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Delivery Ownership
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead planning and delivery of customer-facing digital products and enhancements, from discovery through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project scope, timelines, risks, dependencies, and delivery milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress, report status, and ensure delivery stays within agreed budget and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile Execution &amp;amp; Ceremonies
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate agile ceremonies including sprint planning, stand-ups, reviews, and retrospectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion agile best practices, driving iterative development and adaptive planning across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Stakeholder PartnershipAct as the main point of contact for delivery updates, issue resolution, and stakeholder communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with customers, translating business priorities into clear delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Team Coordination
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate product owners, designers, engineers, and business analysts to keep work aligned with customer priorities and acceptance criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and guidance to project teams, fostering continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Awareness &amp;amp; Release Management
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply working knowledge of the digital product lifecycle, user needs, and release management to inform delivery decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support product thinking by helping teams translate business needs into workable digital outcomes.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
