&lt;li&gt;10 - 15 years of experience managing digital projects or product delivery in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading full software or digital product delivery lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and customer communication skills, with the ability to influence decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of digital product development, including release cycles and prioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities, risks, and dependencies in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with delivery tools and collaboration platforms used in agile teams (e.g. Jira, Confluence, Azure DevOps).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in delivering complex projects in the Singapore Public Sector or large enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
