&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7383px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 275.801px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team, Not Siloed Offerings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 381.895px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;459&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apps, automation, and AI aren&#39;t separate teams here - you&#39;ll work across all three as one connected practice, not get boxed into a single lane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7383px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 275.801px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our DNA, Not Bolted On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 381.895px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;459&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regardless of platform, every specialist here is AI-enabled by design, powered by our own in-house AI workbench that pairs humans and AI from discovery to testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7383px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 275.801px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future-Proof Your Career&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 381.895px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;459&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tech trends come and go - today&#39;s hot platform is tomorrow&#39;s afterthought. We multi-skill our people across platforms and AI so your career keeps growing no matter where the market moves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 72.7383px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 275.801px; height: 72.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;APAC&#39;s Biggest AI-Integrated Practice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 381.895px; height: 72.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;459&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across every platform we work in, our AI-integrated practice is the largest in the region, with work good enough to be cited at Google&#39;s own AI event.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7383px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 275.801px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow With Us Across ASEAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 381.895px; height: 86.7383px;&quot; width=&quot;459&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re one of Singapore&#39;s 100 Fastest Growing Companies, expanding fast across Thailand and Malaysia - plenty of room to grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SimplifyNext, we’re committed to building a team of curious, driven, and forward-thinking individuals who care deeply about creating meaningful impact through technology. If you’re excited by the opportunity to grow, collaborate, and shape the future of digital transformation across the region, we’d be happy to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SimplifyNext is a Singapore-headquartered digital engineering firm, with offices in Thailand and Malaysia, working across three converged areas: agentic AI, AI-enabled application modernisation, and intelligent automation.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We bring strong business process consulting together with deep technology skills and modern delivery practices – product-centric, agile and AI-assisted. We build bespoke applications and AI systems, and we go deep on the platforms our clients run on, including Microsoft, AWS, ServiceNow, Databricks and UiPath. That combination of engineering depth and platform depth is what our clients come to us for.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We build and modernise the systems people depend on daily. Our 300+ practitioners are multi-disciplinary by design – business consultants, software engineers, architects, AI engineers and designers working on the same delivery, not handing off between silos. We focus on delivering outcomes for clients, building strong careers for our people, and staying ahead of the technology curve. We hire because we are growing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33165992 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33165992 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are seeking a talented &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow Developer&lt;/strong&gt; who wants to grow fast, work on exciting projects, and get mentored by senior architects. If&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33165992 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33165992 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking to go beyond routine development and into next-gen digital solutions, this is your opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW33165992 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The position will be tailored to match your experience level and expertise within the ServiceNow ecosystem, with clear pathways for growth from developer to consultant to architect roles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
