&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the full recruitment lifecycle from job posting to offer stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen resumes and conduct initial candidate outreach and phone screenings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and schedule interviews with candidates and hiring managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support interview preparation, evaluation tracking, and candidate feedback consolidation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a positive and professional candidate experience throughout the hiring process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Talent Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively source candidates through LinkedIn and other platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in building and maintaining talent pipelines for tech and consulting roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative sourcing strategies to attract high-quality candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support campus outreach and internship hiring initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding &amp;amp; Recruitment Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
