&lt;li&gt;Assist in crafting and refining job descriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recruitment-related social media content and employer branding efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate career fair participation, networking events, and university engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Operations &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
