&lt;p&gt;As a Consultant at SimplifyNext, you’ll play a key role in delivering automation-led digital transformation. You’ll work closely with clients to design, develop, and implement intelligent solutions using leading technologies in Robotic Process Automation (RPA), artificial intelligence (AI), and analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role where you’ll contribute across the full project lifecycle—from discovery to deployment—and guide junior team members along the way. Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with clients to understand business requirements and translate them into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and developing automations using platforms such as ServiceNow, UiPath, Microsoft Power Automate, Outsystems, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating AI capabilities like computer vision or natural language processing where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading workstreams and supporting project management activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting testing, user training, and supporting rollout activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining and enhancing existing solutions, ensuring long-term value for the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring junior team members and sharing technical know-how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s Degree and 2–3 years of experience in a consulting or technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in VB.NET, C#, or similar object-oriented languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the software development lifecycle and agile delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A logical mindset and creative problem-solving abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a small project or a workstream is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
