&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and deploy enterprise-grade UiPath automations that are secure, scalable, and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the full automation lifecycle – from process analysis to testing, deployment, and production support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable components and frameworks that accelerate automation delivery across projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement best practices in governance, development, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI and Agentic AI capabilities, where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business analysts, solution architects, and delivery leads to define automation opportunities and translate them into technical workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior developers and contribute to knowledge-sharing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase and prototype new UiPath capabilities to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes This Role Exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with top automation and AI experts in a fast-growing regional consulting environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on high-impact Automation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of SimplifyNext’s vision to blend AI, Apps, and Automation into truly agentic enterprise solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a rewarding career in a company that keeps you ahead of the curve, continuously upskilling you in UiPath, AI, and emerging automation technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
