&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of UiPath development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of UiPath REFramework, Orchestrator, Queues, and API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UiPath Advanced RPA Developer (UiARD) certification (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of automation design principles, with analytical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in scripting or development using VB.NET, C#, or Python will be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UiPath Document Understanding, Test Automation, and AI integration will be a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile mindset with strong communication and collaboration skills across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
